4.032', '0'), ('cmh1mc1ku001l12b4oc11b005', 'cmh1mbsvv001a12b4n3v4w14q', 'assistant', 'Hi there! 👋 I''m Lush aunty AI assistant — your natural juice assistant 🍹 We make handcrafted concentrates in Rose, Passion Fruit, and Ginger-Lime. Would you like to see our prices or place an order?', 'text', '2025-10-22 06:34:49.471', '0'), ('cmh1mcywx001n12b44hnibrkh', 'cmh1mbsvv001a12b4n3v4w14q', 'customer', 'Can you please explain about the juice', 'text', '2025-10-22 06:35:32.673', '0'), ('cmh1md5bw001u12b4wmmkt5gj', 'cmh1mbsvv001a12b4n3v4w14q', 'assistant', 'Hi 😊 I’d love to share about our fresh juice concentrates! We have three delightful flavors: Rose Concentrate 🌹 (fragrant and cooling with real rose petals), Passion Fruit Concentrate 🥭 (tangy and tropical), and Ginger-Lime Concentrate 🍋 (spicy and zesty). All are handmade in small batches with natural ingredients, no preservatives. You can enjoy them chilled with water or soda! Each comes in 250ml for ₹440 or 900ml for ₹650. Would you like to try any flavor or mix some?', 'text', '2025-10-22 06:35:40.988', '0'), ('cmh1me04x001w12b40rqg8es2', 'cmh1mbsvv001a12b4n3v4w14q', 'customer', 'What was the ratio mam for mixing?', 'text', '2025-10-22 06:36:20.913', '0'), ('cmh1me48k002312b4oblwjc49', 'cmh1mbsvv001a12b4n3v4w14q', 'assistant', 'Hi 😊 For our juice concentrates, the usual mix ratio is about 1 part concentrate to 3-4 parts water or soda, but you can adjust to your taste! Would you like me to help you pick flavors and quantities to try? 🍹✨', 'text', '2025-10-22 06:36:26.228', '0'), ('cmh1mep1f002512b4cbbm662r', 'cmh1mbsvv001a12b4n3v4w14q', 'customer', 'Yes man. Is there any health benefits?', 'text', '2025-10-22 06:36:53.187', '0'), ('cmh1meu3t002c12b45r6yj67p', 'cmh1mbsvv001a12b4n3v4w14q', 'assistant', 'Hi! Our juice concentrates are handmade with natural ingredients, no preservatives, and packed with fresh flavors. Rose is cooling and fragrant 🌹, Passion Fruit is tangy and energizing 🥭, and Ginger-Lime is zesty and re