25-10-30 03:19:37.36', '3995'), ('cmhcuwu3u000ekv1do50343hm', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'customer', 'What will a rose taste like?', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:20:24.426', '0'), ('cmhcuwwyg000yhxjzn7o7ujpf', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'assistant', 'Rose concentrate is fragrant, cooling, and made with real rose petals. A delicate floral taste that''s refreshing and soothing. Would you like to try a bottle or add it to your order? 🌹😊', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:20:28.12', '3954'), ('cmhcuxfr4000hkv1dfo6m6sqg', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'customer', 'How to use this one', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:20:52.48', '0'), ('cmhcuxiib0015hxjz20c8s3rn', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'assistant', 'Our handmade juice concentrates are best served chilled. Just mix a small amount with water or soda for a refreshing, natural taste. Enjoy your Ginger-Lime concentrate! 🍹😊', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:20:56.051', '3919'), ('cmhcuxroi000kkv1dlbt8dh48', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'customer', 'Can you give me the step by step instructions', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:21:07.938', '0'), ('cmhcuxuif001chxjzakvj9uzo', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'assistant', 'Sure! 😊 Here are the steps to enjoy your Ginger-Lime concentrate:
1. Chill the concentrate bottle.
2. Pour about 30ml (2 tablespoons) of concentrate into a glass.
3. Add 150ml of cold water or soda, depending on your taste.
4. Stir well and add ice if you like.
5. Enjoy your refreshing drink! 🍹 If you want, I can also share tips for other flavors.', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:21:11.607', '3970'), ('cmhcuyay2000nkv1dt1phwzxh', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'customer', 'Yes please', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:21:32.907', '0'), ('cmhcuydf9001jhxjzlpdtdbc8', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'assistant', 'Great! 😊 Here are tips for other flavors:
- Rose: Mix 30ml concentrate with 150ml cold water or soda. It''s delicately floral and cooling.
- Passion Fruit: Mix 30ml with 150ml cold water or soda for a tangy, tropical refreshment.
Enjoy your drinks! 🍹 Let me know if you''d like to add any more flavors to your order.', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:21:36.117', '3987'), ('cmhcuz12x000qkv1du8siailz', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'customer', 'What passion fruit will be like.', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:22:06.778', '0'), ('cmhcuz4ui001qhxjzw9pwjhhq', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'assistant', 'Passion Fruit concentrate is tangy, tropical, and energizing — perfect for a refreshing drink! Mix about 30ml with 150ml cold water or soda for the best taste. Would you like to add some to your order? 🍹😊', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:22:11.658', '4006'), ('cmhcv03f9000tkv1d49zf4b22', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'customer', 'How long will you take to prepare one if I order one now?', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:22:56.469', '0'), ('cmhcv05xb001xhxjzacedr9qe', 'cmh94si7s006gm5518w4zolkp', 'assistant', 'Our concentrates are handmade in small batches, so we prepare fresh orders quickly. Usually, it takes about 1-2 hours to prepare a bottle if ordered now. 😊🍹', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:22:59.711', '3993'), ('cmhcv1adv000wkv1dnfojtzya', 'cmh8hyy34000ckoummnj564x4', 'customer', 'Hello mam. How will you prepareimg the Karuppu kavni brownie. Can you share and step by step instructions', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:23:52.148', '0'), ('cmhcv1dkl0024hxjzgfwia6an', 'cmh8hyy34000ckoummnj564x4', 'assistant', 'Hi 😊 Our Karuppu Kavuni Brownie is lovingly handmade using Karuppu Kavuni black rice, dark chocolate, and jaggery. While I can''t share the full recipe steps, I can assure you it''s freshly baked without any maida or artificial sweeteners, packed with care for freshness and taste. If you have any other questions or want to place an order, just let me know! 🍫❤️', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:23:56.277', '4540'), ('cmhcv2a23000zkv1defgk7w5c', 'cmh8hyy34000ckoummnj564x4', 'customer', 'Atleast share me the ingredients mam and the portion', 'text', '2025-10-30 03:24:38.379', '0'), ('cmhcv2cg4002bhxjzgo4cg9b3', 'cmh8hyy34000ckoummnj564x4', 'assistant', 'Hi